## [0.1.0] - 2025-01-19

### Added
- Browser Compatibility Utility (`app/utils/browserCompat.ts`) with cross-browser optimization
- LogoCloud Mobile-First Responsive Design System
- ScrollStack Browser-Specific Configuration System
- LogoCloud Conditional Mobile Logo Rendering
- Initial project setup with Next.js 15.4.7
- React 19.1.0 with TypeScript support
- Tailwind CSS v4 for styling
- Framer Motion for animations
- Lucide React for icons
- React Hook Form with Zod validation
- Recharts for data visualization
- ESLint configuration
- Basic project structure with marketing and dashboard routes

### Technical Details
- **Framework**: Next.js 15.4.7
- **Language**: TypeScript 5
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **UI Components**: Headless UI React
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod
- **Charts**: Recharts

### Added
- Infinite Scroll Component Implementation for Case Studies Page
  - Created InfiniteScroll.tsx component with GSAP-based animations
  - Implemented ReviewCard.tsx component for customer testimonials
  - Added infinite scroll effect with tilted 3D perspective
  - Integrated autoplay functionality with pause on hover
  - Added touch, wheel, and pointer interaction support
  - Implemented scalable data structure for easy review addition
  - Updated Case Studies page with "Real Reviews" section
  - Added 3 authentic customer reviews with results data
  - Maintained existing dark theme and indigo/purple color scheme
  - Optimized for mobile responsiveness and accessibility

### Changed
